Note on the "Portal" name and brand:

The MIT license above grants you broad rights to the source code, but does
not grant rights to the "Portal" trademark or branding (logo, app icon,
domain names like portal.1pro.uz). If you fork this project, please use a
distinct name for your distribution to avoid user confusion.

The Portal Cipher Protocol (PCP-1), specified under client/crypt/pcp/, is
also released under the MIT license for use by any project. Cryptographic
properties and security guarantees are documented in client/crypt/pcp/SPEC.md.
